  "style": "Polite आप with the करें imperative (सहेजें, हटाएँ, प्रकाशित करें). Common tech loanwords in Devanagari (साइट, पेज, डोमेन, टोकन); product and technical names in Latin script. End sentences with the danda । (no space before it); keep ? and ! as is. Curly quotes “ ”, ellipsis …. Nukta spellings: ड्राफ़्ट, फ़ीडबैक, ज़रूरत. Chandrabindu in -एँ endings (हटाएँ, सूचनाएँ). Western digits. Plural messages keep one and *."
